<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BarberShop - Home</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/aos@next/dist/aos.css" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --sidebar-brown: #3d1f14;
            --accent-gold: #d4a373;
            --text-creme: #e6d5c3;
            --bg-dark: #120a07;
            --nav-width: 100px;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: white;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
        }

        .side-navigation {
            width: var(--nav-width);
            background: rgba(18, 10, 7, 0.95);
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 30px 0;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.1);
            position: fixed;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 25px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-item-link {
            color: rgba(230, 213, 195, 0.5);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            transition: 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        .nav-item-link:hover, .nav-item-link.active {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            background: rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.05);
        }

        .nav-label {
            font-size: 0.55rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 5px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            margin-left: var(--nav-width);
            width: calc(100% - var(--nav-width));
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="side-navigation">
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li>
                <a href="/mvc/views/usuario/UsuarioView.ejs" class="nav-item-link active">
                    <i class="bi bi-house"></i>
                    <span class="nav-label">Home</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="/user/list" class="nav-item-link">
                    <i class="bi bi-people"></i>
                    <span class="nav-label">Usuários</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="/user/create" class="nav-item-link">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-plus"></i>
                    <span class="nav-label">Novo Cadastro</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="my-2" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,163,115,0.2); width: 60%; align-self: center;"></li>
            <li>
                <a href="/atendimento/list" class="nav-item-link">
                    <i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i>
                    <span class="nav-label">Atendimentos</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="/atendimento/create" class="nav-item-link">
                    <i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i>
                    <span class="nav-label">Agendar</span>
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="main-content">
        <header class="hero-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-7" data-aos="fade-right">
                        <h1 class="hero-title">Domine seu estilo, <br><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">eleve sua presença.</span></h1>
                        <p class="lead mb-4" style="max-width: 500px; color: var(--text-creme); opacity: 0.8;">
                            Você merece se sentir incrível todos os dias. Descubra nossos serviços exclusivos.
                        </p>
                        <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
                            <a href="#servicos" class="btn-custom btn-outline-style">Saiba Mais</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@next/dist/aos.js"></script>
    <script>
        AOS.init({ duration: 1000, once: true });
    </script>
</body>
</html>